text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn for each Swamp you control.', "As Primal Clay enters the battlefield, it becomes your choice of a 3/3 artifact creature, a 2/2 artifact creature with flying, or a 1/6 Wall artifact creature with defender in addition to its other types. (A creature with defender can't attack.)", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card.\nDraw two cards.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, count the number of permanents you control. Your life total becomes that number.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, draw a card.\n{T}: Staff of Nin deals 1 damage to any target.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have 200 or more cards in your library, you win the game.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, return a creature you control to its owner's hand.", 'Attacking creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Cathedral of War enters the battlefield tapped.\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\n{T}: Add {C}.', "Chandra's Fury deals 4 damage to target player or planeswalker and 1 damage to each creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls.", 'Copy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target noncreature spell.', 'Counter target spell. Untap up to four lands.', 'Create X 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens, where X is the greatest power among creatures you control.', 'Create three 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.', 'Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Create two 2/2 blue Drake creature tokens with flying.', 'Creatures you control gain double strike until end of turn. (They deal both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +3/+3 until end of turn. Each creature your opponents control blocks this turn if able.', 'Creatures you control have flying, first strike, vigilance, trample, haste, and protection from black and from red.', 'Creatures you control have haste. (They can attack and {T} as soon as they come under your control.)', 'Creatures your opponents control get -1/-1 until end of turn.', "Crimson Muckwader gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Swamp.\n{2}{B}: Regenerate Crimson Muckwader. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "Crusader of Odric's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.", 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\nWhen Acidic Slime enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', "Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\n{2}{B}, {T}: Put a petrification counter on target creature. It gains defender and becomes a colorless artifact in addition to its other types. Its activated abilities can't be activated. (A creature with defender can't attack.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{R}: Wall of Fire gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Defender, flying\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by Fog Bank.', 'Destroy all nonland permanents.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target attacking or blocking creature.', 'Destroy target creature an opponent controls. Each other creature that player controls gets -2/-0 until end of turn.', 'Destroy target creature with flying.', 'Destroy target creature.', 'Destroy target land.', 'Door to Nothingness enters the battlefield tapped.\n{W}{W}{U}{U}{B}{B}{R}{R}{G}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Door to Nothingness: Target player loses the game.', 'Dragonskull Summit enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Swamp or a Mountain.\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Draw two cards.', 'Drowned Catacomb enters the battlefield tapped unless you control an Island or a Swamp.\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', "Enchant artifact or creature\nEnchanted permanent doesn't untap during its controller's untap step and its activated abilities can't be activated.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and can't be blocked.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has trample.\nWhen Rancor is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Rancor to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has lifelink.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has mountainwalk. (It can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -1/-1 and can't block.", 'Enchant creature\nWhen Dark Favor enters the battlefield, you lose 1 life.\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+1.', 'Enchant creature\nWhen Divine Favor enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+3.', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has flying.\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Equipped creature has haste. (It can attack and {T} no matter when it came under your control.)\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's red.\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "Equipped creature has trample. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's green.\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "Equipped creature has vigilance. (Attacking doesn't cause it to tap.)\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's white.\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", 'Essence Drain deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, you may tap target creature.', "Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\n{3}{B}: Regenerate Duty-Bound Dead. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", 'Exchange control of two target creatures.', "Exile all permanents. Exile all cards from all hands and graveyards. Each player's life total becomes 1.", 'Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Exile target enchantment.', "Exile target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard and target instant or sorcery card from an opponent's graveyard. Copy those cards. Cast the copies if able without paying their mana costs. Exile Spelltwine.", 'First strike\nWhen Attended Knight enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token.', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\nWhenever Odric, Master Tactician and at least three other creatures attack, you choose which creatures block this combat and how those creatures block.', 'Flames of the Firebrand deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nFlying', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nYou may cast green creature spells as though they had flash.', 'Flinthoof Boar gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Mountain.\n{R}: Flinthoof Boar gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Flying', 'Flying\nArctic Aven gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Plains.\n{W}: Arctic Aven gains lifelink until end of turn. (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Flying\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Flying\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\nOther creatures you control have exalted. (If a creature has multiple instances of exalted, each triggers separately.)', 'Flying\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\nWhenever Nefarox, Overlord of Grixis attacks alone, defending player sacrifices a creature.', 'Flying\nHaste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nWhen Thundermaw Hellkite enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to each creature with flying your opponents control. Tap those creatures.', "Flying\nJace's Phantasm gets +4/+4 as long as an opponent has ten or more cards in their graveyard.", "Flying\nSlumbering Dragon can't attack or block unless it has five or more +1/+1 counters on it.\nWhenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, put a +1/+1 counter on Slumbering Dragon.", "Flying\nWar Falcon can't attack unless you control a Knight or a Soldier.", 'Flying\nWhen Battleflight Eagle enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhen Bloodhunter Bat enters the battlefield, target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', 'Flying\nWhen Sphinx of Uthuun enters the battlefield, reveal the top five cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', "Flying\nWhenever Shimian Specter deals combat damage to a player, that player reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it. Search that player's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as that card and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", 'Flying\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, Griffin Protector gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{1}{R}{R}{R}: Return Firewing Phoenix from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Flying\n{R}: Dragon Hatchling gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{R}: Furnace Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWelkin Tern can block only creatures with flying.", 'Flying, deathtouch, lifelink', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Put a +1/+1 counter on it and untap it. That creature gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Glacial Fortress enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Plains or an Island.\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', "Harbor Bandit gets +1/+1 as long as you control an Island.\n{1}{U}: Harbor Bandit can't be blocked this turn.", 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nReckless Brute attacks each combat if able.', "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", 'Indestructible\nAs Phylactery Lich enters the battlefield, put a phylactery counter on an artifact you control.\nWhen you control no permanents with phylactery counters on them, sacrifice Phylactery Lich.', 'Indestructible\nAs Stuffy Doll enters the battlefield, choose a player.\nWhenever Stuffy Doll is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to the chosen player.\n{T}: Stuffy Doll deals 1 damage to itself.', "Intimidate (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)", "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\nAll lands are Islands in addition to their other types.\nCreatures without flying or islandwalk can't attack.", "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\nHarbor Serpent can't attack unless there are five or more Islands on the battlefield.", 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)\nIf you would gain life, you gain twice that much life instead.', 'Look at the top five cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Magmaquake deals X damage to each creature without flying and each planeswalker.', "Mogg Flunkies can't attack or block alone.", 'Other Elf creatures you control get +1/+1.\n{T}: Add {G} for each Elf you control.', "Other Merfolk creatures you control get +1/+1 and have islandwalk. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Play with the top card of your library revealed.\nAs long as the top card of your library is black, Vampire Nocturnus and other Vampire creatures you control get +2/+1 and have flying.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to you and creatures you control this turn.', 'Primordial Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, double the number of +1/+1 counters on Primordial Hydra.\nPrimordial Hydra has trample as long as it has ten or more +1/+1 counters on it.', "Prized Elephant gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Forest.\n{G}: Prized Elephant gains trample until end of turn. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Protection from black (This creature can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything black.)\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)", "Protection from white (This creature can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything white.)\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)", 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. That creature is a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types.', 'Rain of Blades deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.', 'Reach\n{X}{G}{G}: Silklash Spider deals X damage to each creature with flying.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Return target green card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Return to the battlefield all permanent cards in your graveyard that were put there from the battlefield this turn.', 'Rootbound Crag enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Mountain or a Forest.\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Bloodthrone Vampire gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Search your library for a Plains, Island, Swamp, or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to X basic land cards, where X is the number of lands you control, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to X cards, put those cards into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to two Forest cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Searing Spear deals 3 damage to any target.', "Serra Avatar's power and toughness are each equal to your life total.\nWhen Serra Avatar is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library.", 'Sunpetal Grove enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Forest or a Plains.\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', "Tap all creatures target player controls. Those creatures don't untap during that player's next untap step.", 'Tap two untapped artifacts you control: Untap target artifact.', 'Tap up to three target creatures.', 'Target creature gains deathtouch until end of turn. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Target creature gets +1/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +2/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -5/-0 until end of turn.', "Target creature you control fights target creature you don't control. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", 'Target opponent mills seven cards.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player discards their hand.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player draws two cards and loses 2 life.', 'Timberpack Wolf gets +1/+1 for each other creature you control named Timberpack Wolf.', "Tormented Soul can't block and can't be blocked.", 'Trample\nWhen Elderscale Wurm enters the battlefield, if your life total is less than 7, your life total becomes 7.\nAs long as you have 7 or more life, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 7 reduces it to 7 instead.', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", 'Turn to Slag deals 5 damage to target creature. Destroy all Equipment attached to that creature.', "Veilborn Ghoul can't block.\nWhenever a Swamp enters the battlefield under your control, you may return Veilborn Ghoul from your graveyard to your hand.", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\nOther Soldier creatures you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance.\nWhen Captain of the Watch enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.", 'Vigilance, reach', 'Volcanic Geyser deals X damage to any target.', 'When Archaeomancer enters the battlefield, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Augur of Bolas enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal an instant or sorcery card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'When Bond Beetle enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "When Disciple of Bolas enters the battlefield, sacrifice another creature. You gain X life and draw X cards, where X is that creature's power.", 'When Elvish Visionary enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Goblin Arsonist dies, you may have it deal 1 damage to any target.', "When Ground Seal enters the battlefield, draw a card.\nCards in graveyards can't be the targets of spells or abilities.", "When Liliana's Shade enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\n{B}: Liliana's Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", 'When Mindclaw Shaman enters the battlefield, target opponent reveals their hand. You may cast an instant or sorcery spell from among those cards without paying its mana cost.', 'When Mwonvuli Beast Tracker enters the battlefield, search your library for a creature card with deathtouch, hexproof, reach, or trample and reveal it. Shuffle and put that card on top.', "When Oblivion Ring enters the battlefield, exile another target nonland permanent.\nWhen Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'When Ravenous Rats enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card.', 'When Thragtusk enters the battlefield, you gain 5 life.\nWhen Thragtusk leaves the battlefield, create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.', 'When War Priest of Thune enters the battlefield, you may destroy target enchantment.', "When Yeva's Forcemage enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.", 'Whenever Scroll Thief deals combat damage to a player, draw a card.', "Whenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, that creature's controller loses 1 life.", 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 2 life.', "Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may put X +1/+1 counters on Hamletback Goliath, where X is that creature's power.", 'Whenever another creature with power 3 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, you may draw a card.', "Whenever you cast a red spell, target creature can't block this turn.", "Whenever you cast a spell that's white, blue, black, or red, put a +1/+1 counter on Quirion Dryad.", 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 2/2 blue Drake creature token with flying.', "You can't cast this spell during your first, second, or third turns of the game.\nFlying, vigilance", 'You gain 1 life for each land you control.', 'You gain 7 life.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'You may cast spells from your hand without paying their mana costs.', 'You may choose new targets for target spell.', 'You may have Clone enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature on the battlefield.', '[+1]: Chandra, the Firebrand deals 1 damage to any target.\n[−2]: When you next cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.\n[−6]: Chandra, the Firebrand deals 6 damage to each of up to six targets.', '[+1]: Create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.\n[−3]: Draw cards equal to the greatest power among creatures you control.\n[−6]: Create a 6/6 green Wurm creature token for each land you control.', '[+1]: Draw a card. Target player mills a card.\n[0]: Target player mills ten cards.\n[−7]: Any number of target players each draw twenty cards.', '[+1]: Put a +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature.\n[−3]: Target creature gains flying and double strike until end of turn.\n[−8]: Create X 2/2 white Cat creature tokens, where X is your life total.', '[+1]: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\n[−3]: Target creature gets +X/+X or -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of Swamps you control.\n[−6]: You get an emblem with "Swamps you control have \'{T}: Add {B}{B}{B}{B}.\'"', "[+3]: Destroy target noncreature permanent.\n[−2]: Gain control of target creature.\n[−9]: Nicol Bolas, Planeswalker deals 7 damage to target player or planeswalker. That player or that planeswalker's controller discards seven cards, then sacrifices seven permanents.", '{1}, {T}, Discard a card: You gain 4 life.\n{1}, {T}, Pay 1 life: Create a 0/1 white Goat creature token.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Draw a card.', '{1}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Chronomaton.', '{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Arms Dealer deals 4 damage to target creature.', "{2}, {T}: You gain 5 life. Shuffle Elixir of Immortality and your graveyard into their owner's library.", "{2}: Equipped creature gains hexproof until end of turn. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's blue.\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "{2}: Regenerate equipped creature. (The next time that creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's black.\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "{2}{U}, {T}: Put Void Stalker and target creature on top of their owners' libraries, then those players shuffle their libraries.", '{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Gem of Becoming: Search your library for an Island card, a Swamp card, and a Mountain card. Reveal those cards, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', '{4}, {T}: Draw a card.', '{R}, Sacrifice Torch Fiend: Destroy target artifact.', '{T}, Discard a card: Draw a card.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}, Sacrifice Tormod's Crypt: Exile target player's graveyard.", '{T}: Add three mana of any one color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}{R}, {T}: Put a pressure counter on Hellion Crucible.\n{1}{R}, {T}, Remove two pressure counters from Hellion Crucible and sacrifice it: Create a 4/4 red Hellion creature token with haste. (It can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', '{T}: Create X 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens, where X is the number of Goblins you control.', '{T}: Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater.', '{T}: Target creature attacks this turn if able.\n{T}: Target creature blocks this turn if able.', '{T}: Untap target Forest.', '{U}, {T}: Target player mills two cards.', '{U}: Watercourser gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', '{X}, {T}: Target player mills X cards.']
